      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/moderate",
      ":question/problem": "Which of the following statements are true regarding the matrix $A$ given below?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** $A$ is a singular matrix\n- **II.** $det(A)=0$\n- **III.** $det(A)=- \\sqrt{7}$\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 2 & 0 \\\\ -1 & \\sqrt{7} & 1 \\\\ \\sqrt{7} & -7 & - \\sqrt{7}\\end{bmatrix}\n$$",
